Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.66,0:00:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.86,0:02:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long have you been still?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been watching you the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.62,0:02:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are one creepy guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.46,0:02:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I really must say, I'm\Nsurprised you decided to appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.82,0:02:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you think it was the\Nidle talk of a drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can hardly blame me\Nif I did, now can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.98,0:02:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're stuck in a cellar like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.12,0:02:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with gunpowder up your\Nnose for over twenty years,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.96,0:02:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you stop caring whether\Nor not talk is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.16,0:02:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So tell me, who am I hunting?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.90,0:02:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I can feel the shivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.68,0:02:41.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suddenly I remember why I've\Nbeen doing this all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.16,0:02:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be sure you show our master your\Ngratitude for keeping you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.39,0:02:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.98,0:02:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been looking for\Nyou for a whole week.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.94,0:02:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was told that you're rarely\Nopen because you sell other stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.96,0:02:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, besides boots, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:02:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.55,0:03:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Sonny, you sure like to talk a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you like to talk\Nabout boots for your sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.20,0:03:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.11,0:03:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's something else I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.84,0:03:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll abide by your rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.08,0:03:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't make any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.10,0:03:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this the most beautiful\Nday you've ever seen, Meryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.94,0:03:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.14,0:03:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the kind of day\Nthat just makes you want
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.04,0:03:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to sit here and forget\Nall about your problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.08,0:03:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.08,0:03:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.64,0:03:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, it makes you want to completely\Nforget about work and take the day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a chance, but nice try.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.72,0:03:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.18,0:03:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get it over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.00,0:03:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sky is unbelievably blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:03:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, give me the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.86,0:04:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There I go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.12,0:04:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess it's kind of stupid, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.32,0:04:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still keep thinking how\NI'd like to show it to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.80,0:04:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though that's no longer possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.90,0:04:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.12,0:04:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.34,0:04:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.90,0:04:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The deadly dodgeball head!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.68,0:04:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A simple technique to hold the\Nball in place with intense suction!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try this at home, kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.82,0:04:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Mr. Bash!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.82,0:04:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the hell is that man doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.10,0:04:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it wonderful, Meryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.87,0:05:03.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the Vash we know and love is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.34,0:05:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you gone insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.60,0:05:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.78,0:05:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, guys, who wants ice cream, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.34,0:05:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you treating?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.30,0:05:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.38,0:05:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get six, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.90,0:05:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why do you want six of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.42,0:05:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that one too many?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.76,0:05:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One is for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.58,0:05:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got a ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to come and play?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.12,0:05:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.40,0:05:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're over here, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.91,0:05:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.72,0:05:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, mister! Over here! I'll get him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.42,0:06:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found you, Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.14,0:06:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.14,0:06:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.50,0:06:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Legato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.86,0:06:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Legato Blue Summers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.92,0:06:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Vash? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.94,0:06:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, it's n-nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.62,0:06:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.80,0:06:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Corée! Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.74,0:06:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that strange look on his face?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.34,0:06:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was frightening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.10,0:06:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.80,0:06:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.12,0:07:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps that was a bit too dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.60,0:07:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm here as a messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.80,0:07:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've come here to warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.30,0:07:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid your life\Nis going to end today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.52,0:07:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm lying to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.74,0:07:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't given you a gift yet, have I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.06,0:07:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your reaction was better than I hoped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.10,0:07:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.34,0:08:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to think I could kill every man,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.60,0:08:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,woman, and child here in the\Nblink of an eye if I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.72,0:08:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power of death is intoxicating.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be in so much of a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.30,0:08:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still have a little time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or, perhaps you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.68,0:08:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't worry, no one\Nelse needs to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.70,0:08:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So do you want to draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.82,0:08:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.82,0:08:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a little farewell gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.82,0:08:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It contains a lesson from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.20,0:08:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just leave it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.86,0:08:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.18,0:08:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.20,0:08:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a shoemaker's wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.24,0:08:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, she looks really upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! It's a murder!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.48,0:08:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, calm down. Murder?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.64,0:08:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.55,0:08:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.62,0:08:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My husband!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:09:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My husband's in there, but he won't talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.48,0:09:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't say anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.18,0:09:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't\Nseem to understand you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.38,0:09:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.10,0:09:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.14,0:09:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't say a word!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.38,0:09:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My husband!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.29,0:09:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My husband!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.84,0:09:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sheriff, he didn't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.46,0:09:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.76,0:09:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save it for the judge to decide,\Nlady, this is not a courthouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.16,0:09:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, we have witness testimony\Nthat places him at the shoe store.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.02,0:09:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He also just happened to be the one\Nclosest by when the owner's body was found.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.74,0:09:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we've got evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.00,0:09:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's more,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.91,0:09:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we ran a check and found\Nout he's that humanoid
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.78,0:09:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,typhoon everyone's been\Ntalking about lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.34,0:09:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd have to be completely out of\Nmy mind not to lock up that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.10,0:09:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if I were to cut him loose and\Nhe was to make off into the night,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.66,0:09:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would you take the heat?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.80,0:09:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:10:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a little farewell gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.96,0:10:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just leave it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.26,0:10:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid your life\Nis going to end today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.60,0:10:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does he want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A 60 billion double dollar reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.86,0:10:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.78,0:10:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.24,0:10:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.42,0:10:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, Mr. Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.48,0:10:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.39,0:10:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is everything all right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.14,0:10:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.14,0:10:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. Oh, Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.14,0:11:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry about all of this, but will\Nyou please stay here just for today?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.66,0:11:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll come for you tomorrow. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.18,0:11:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's nice, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.70,0:11:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't go out of\Nyour way from me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as I know, you're innocent\Nand haven't done anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.30,0:11:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need some time alone to think right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, hey, Mr. Vash? Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, actually, actually it's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.04,0:11:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that mean, Millie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.14,0:11:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, it means nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.12,0:11:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.34,0:11:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.58,0:12:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.90,0:12:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.48,0:12:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for showing me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.68,0:12:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me, Vash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.88,0:12:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Monev the Gale,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.00,0:12:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm here to send you to\Nhell just as you were promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.32,0:13:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of you, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.42,0:13:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.50,0:13:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out while you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.64,0:13:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.55,0:13:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.48,0:13:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.34,0:13:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is he and what is he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.64,0:13:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was simple. Simple\Nenough to make me realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.74,0:13:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been wasting my life.\NLet go of him right now
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.58,0:13:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know just how long 20 years is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.80,0:13:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,imprisoned in that\Ndisgusting place with nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to do but physical\Ntraining it was like living
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.24,0:13:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the bowels of hell\Nbut once I kill you those
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.70,0:13:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,days of torture will be over forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.50,0:13:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five clicks into the end.\NFour. Three. Two. One.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.90,0:13:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.22,0:14:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true what I was told about this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.88,0:14:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a complete chicken shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Mira? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.80,0:14:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should go after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.20,0:14:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, something's wrong with Bash.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.80,0:14:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.71,0:14:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way he's been acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.90,0:14:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.48,0:14:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like somebody attacked\Nthe sheriff's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.38,0:14:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it Prince of that guy in\Njail trying to set him free?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.80,0:14:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.18,0:14:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run for your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.50,0:14:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.41,0:14:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, don't get near me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.44,0:14:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take cover until I'm safely out of town!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.16,0:14:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.08,0:14:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a matter of life and death here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.14,0:14:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.22,0:14:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash, the Stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.10,0:14:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said sit down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.14,0:14:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.84,0:14:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.38,0:14:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that pinhead\Narrogant little twerk?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.88,0:15:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does he actually think he can get\Naway from me and keep up this pace?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.49,0:15:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run or I'll shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.41,0:15:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, run, hot shot, whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.90,0:15:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiots, I warned you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.78,0:15:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still helping others\Neven at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.32,0:15:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.28,0:15:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have any expectations of staying\Nalive, you better use them as a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.58,0:15:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, it'll\Nall be over soon anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.04,0:15:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's the end of Vash the Stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.00,0:15:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and this town die together!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.20,0:16:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.08,0:16:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.14,0:16:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much for the legendary\Noutlaw! He was nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.54,0:16:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He died like a coward! At last!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last I'm free!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.94,0:16:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can live the way I want to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.54,0:17:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.20,0:17:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.11,0:17:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this must be a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.60,0:17:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.40,0:17:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like looking in\Nthe eyes of the Diablo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.46,0:17:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did go this way, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.84,0:17:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.10,0:17:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.78,0:18:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.26,0:18:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.88,0:18:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.56,0:18:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is not the same man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.80,0:18:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's walking away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.36,0:18:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we let him leave now, he'll\Nprobably never come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.24,0:18:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think we can stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.10,0:18:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way he's acting?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.58,0:18:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think anyone\Ncan stop him right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.54,0:18:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the way he shot at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.38,0:18:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't he supposed to be so spineless\Nthat he's unable to kill a fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.28,0:18:44.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was like the devil himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.50,0:18:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's shown his true nature to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.56,0:18:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I still have to take his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.40,0:18:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.00,0:18:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait! What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.24,0:18:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to use your safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.50,0:18:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.41,0:18:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, sir, I can't... I...\NI... Hurry! There's no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.82,0:19:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two shots left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.90,0:19:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.00,0:19:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.88,0:19:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna use the big safe as a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll mutilate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.76,0:19:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Along with that vault door!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.96,0:19:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no more bullets, coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.28,0:19:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, a hidden gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.94,0:19:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't he use it before?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.00,0:19:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could have shot me then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.78,0:19:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.92,0:19:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.30,0:20:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.28,0:20:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.50,0:20:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.06,0:20:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed all the people!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.18,0:20:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.68,0:20:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you are the ones solely\Nresponsible for all their deaths!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.32,0:20:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you are also going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.90,0:20:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.47,0:20:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.39,0:20:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.30,0:20:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.30,0:20:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna die! Please!\NDon't kill me! Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.96,0:20:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you awake now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.96,0:20:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah but I was dreaming\Nrem everything everything
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:21:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was so horribly dry even people's hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.22,0:21:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From far away as I watched\Nthe people who lived there I
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.16,0:21:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,always found myself wondering\NHow and why could they possibly
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.56,0:21:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,keep on living what motivation\Ndid they have that Would get
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them up every day no matter\Nwhat for the rest of their lives
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.94,0:21:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that you're always so\Nserious even when you're dreaming
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.38,0:21:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll turn into an\Nold man very quickly if
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you keep on constantly\Npondering like that I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.24,0:21:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,excited to think that\Nthe ticket I was handed
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.70,0:21:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on the day of my birth was completely open
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.96,0:21:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The choices we make in life\Nhave unlimited possibilities
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.44,0:21:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I can do is think about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.20,0:22:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.08,0:22:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Vash, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.70,0:22:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.42,0:22:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I shot him now,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.40,0:22:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you really would die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.84,0:22:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be wrong to shoot him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.70,0:22:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blue sky in the middle of the\Nsky, the wind is in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.48,0:22:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The light of the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.64,0:23:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as you can see the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.40,0:23:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,light of the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.84,0:24:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Routine Report, date July Thou.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.78,0:24:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two days after the incident\Ncaused by a man named Monev,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.14,0:24:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tension still runs high in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.44,0:24:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The events that occurred there made\Nme realize something all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.52,0:24:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an awareness which becomes obscured\Nas I keep regular contact with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.88,0:24:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That being, the reason Vash the\NStampede is called the Humanoid Typhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.24,0:24:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet I still don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.76,0:24:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it that so much trouble\Nfalls into this man's lap?

